  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「オリーブ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AA%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%96",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 111315942,
      "text": "オリーブ は、モクセイ科オリーブ属の常緑高木。実が食用油（オリーブ・オイル）の原料や食用になるため、広く栽培されている。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Olea europaea」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olea_europaea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1376609949,
      "text": "Olea europaea is the tree species that includes the cultivated olive, and five other subspecies. Some of the subspecies are polyploid."
    }
  },
